  "description": "Early one morning, Yoojin awakens bleary-eyed to a bright light… Did he fall asleep with the TV on? Surely that isn’t a real-life actor sleeping beside him? No, there’s no mistaking it. The dreamy TV star Ryu Se-ryeon is actually in his bed… and he REEKS of alcohol! How?! When?! WHY?! Perhaps it has something to do with Yoojin’s sister, who just happens to be Se-ryeon’s girlfriend. Sound complicated? You ain’t seen nothin’ yet… \n\n(Source: Lezhin)",
